  "body": "Last Call at The Gardens - This is the final release of our completed apartments - move-in ready and priced to sell.\r\n\r\nDiscover refined living at an unmatched price within the exclusive enclave of Kensington Park. This impeccably finished one-bedroom apartment, perched on the fourth floor, offers a rare opportunity to secure one of the last remaining residences of its kind-and the most attractively priced new-build on offer.\r\n\r\nThoughtfully crafted for effortless elegance, the home welcomes you with a soft, neutral palette, an inviting sense of light, and a timeless limed oak kitchen that blends form and function. The spacious open-plan living flows seamlessly to a private, sun-filled deck, creating the perfect setting for quiet afternoons or intimate gatherings.\r\n\r\nThe bedroom offers ample storage and serene privacy, while secure basement parking and private building access add to the sense of ease and peace of mind.\r\n\r\nThis is a residence designed for those who appreciate the convenience of lock-and-leave living without sacrificing quality or charm. Ideal for discerning downsizers or those seeking a coastal haven with refined amenities.\r\n\r\nAs a resident in this tightly held suburb, you'll have exclusive access to on-site amenities, including a heated indoor pool, gym, sauna, cafe, and beautifully maintained walking trails woven through acres of landscaped grounds. These shared facilities are thoughtfully maintained by the Kensington Park Residents Association for an associated investment of $1,033.61 per annum. This contributes to the upkeep of these exceptional amenities, the ongoing care of community gardens and green spaces, and the smooth management of shared services that enrich your daily lifestyle. \r\n\r\nThis opportunity combines exclusivity and exceptional value - immediate viewing through our advertised open homes is recommended, or call Tonia, Sandra or Paul to view by appointment. \r\n\r\nOnly two, one bedroom apartments, remain - call us today to avoid disappointment.",
